# Testing Standards

## Coverage requirements
- data/quality/gate.py: 100%
- model/engine.py: 90%+
- headless/runner.py: 85%+
- api/routes/: 80%+

## Categories
- Unit tests: isolated with mocked DB/Redis
- Integration tests: run against test Docker services only
- Data quality tests: synthetic NSE edge-case datasets
- Backtests: offline only, never live API

## Fixtures
Use tests/conftest.py for shared fixtures and synthetic dataset helpers.

## Before every PR
Run: pytest tests/unit/ tests/data_quality/ -v --tb=short
